{
  "name": "burrows-wedding-ring-mark",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Mark's wedding ring designer (BurrowsJewellers/ring-magic-studio, copied unchanged into mark/src) built for the Shopify page. shop/ is the adapter: Shopify cart, the droplet price API, Shopify CDN photos/models, the shadow-root mount and staff mode. npm install, npm run build -> ../assets/wedding-ring-builder.js",
